		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ようこそ！
お買い物ですね？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
